-- ─── 0005 — the TOC gets its depth ────────────────────────────────────────────
-- After 0004 every module reached a node, but 25 of the 39 modules landed on a
-- LEAF: the whole of Ṣarf, eight Balāgha modules and seven of Naḥw stopped one
-- level down. A course that ends at its own module list is not a table of
-- contents. These 192 nodes are the fasl/masāʾil layer those modules were
-- missing, following the divisions of the sources already registered against
-- each discipline in ar_learning_source — Ghalāyīnī's Jāmiʿ al-Durūs for naḥw
-- and ṣarf, Qazwīnī's Īḍāḥ and Jurjānī's Dalāʾil for balāgha.
--
-- Each row carries the unit it belongs to, so ar_grammar_node.unit_id stays a
-- complete index of "which module owns this topic", and INSERT OR IGNORE keeps
-- the migration replayable.

